# Cursor / Windsurf Global Rules: Architecture Sync

- Maintain ARCHITECTURE.md as the 100% Single Source of Truth for system architecture.
- Whenever you add/edit any endpoint, database schema, background worker, or external service, update ARCHITECTURE.md in the same turn.
- Tag items with: `✅ In Code`, `◼ Planned`, `⚠️ Needs Review`.
- Never invent architectures without citing actual file paths and line numbers (`file:line`). Missing elements must be stated as `> Not Found`.
